; a disjunction of 30 alternatives is derived at once (since 2026-10-12): rules like
; "excluded-middle", `%A ∨ ¬%A`, were matched against it by splitting the 30 into two groups in
; every way (2^29) -- now `¬%A`, which can only be one alternative, is matched first
